WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.328
In the final years of the Sui dynasty, the whole land fell into chaos.

00:00:02.678 --> 00:00:08.246
Common people everywhere lived in hardship, their faces full of sorrow.

00:00:08.596 --> 00:00:11.500
Many people were forced to leave their home villages.

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:18.018
Heroes of the greenwood flocked to join the Wagang stronghold.

00:00:18.368 --> 00:00:21.608
The stronghold's great gate opened wide for them.

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:24.166
More and more people gathered in the stronghold.

00:00:24.516 --> 00:00:30.516
The banner of righteousness flew high as heroes arrived with their weapons to join together.

00:00:30.866 --> 00:00:34.898
At Wagang the heroes gathered, their blood boiling with passion.

00:00:35.248 --> 00:00:39.976
Together they raised the great banner and swore to resist tyranny as one.

00:00:40.326 --> 00:00:44.886
The Wagang army set out in neat ranks, a mighty and magnificent force.

00:00:45.236 --> 00:00:49.628
The soldiers were full of spirit, their banners fluttering in the wind.

00:00:49.978 --> 00:00:54.802
Under the setting sun, the Wagang stronghold looked especially magnificent.

00:00:55.152 --> 00:00:59.664
This force became an important power among the contending heroes of the late Sui.

00:01:00.014 --> 00:01:02.702
Their story has been passed down to this very day.

